Run Multiple kubernates cluster locally Kubernetes in Docker (KIND-k8 in docker):
--> Here what kind does is in side docker container it creates k8 cluster, lets say we want to run multinode k8 cluster (1 master and 2 worker nodes)
so waht kind does is it creates 3 docker conatainers and within that 1 container creates master node (control plane) 
and 2 containers created for worker nodes(data plane),and kind takes the responsiblities to connect from worker nodes to master node or
data plane to control plane.
Note: During EKS OR AKS  k8 cluster is created under VM .

Prerequisite for Windowds:
1) Docker Desktop should be up and running . check docker info or docker --version
2) kind should be installed using power shell user check kind installation documents for windows , check kind --version

