"""
Kind → Production side-by-side:
"""
| Step                  | Your Kind / Local command              | Production equivalent                                | What you're actually doing                       |
| --------------------- | -------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------ |
| **1. Check Docker**   | `docker --version`                     | `docker --version` / container runtime check         | Verify container runtime                         |
| **2. Create cluster** | `kind create cluster --name mycluster` | `eksctl create cluster` / Terraform / CloudFormation | Provision Kubernetes infrastructure              |
| **3. List clusters**  | `kind get clusters`                    | `kubectl config get-contexts`                        | See available Kubernetes contexts                |
| **4. Check nodes**    | `kubectl get nodes`                    | `kubectl get nodes`                                  | Check worker/control-plane node health           |
| **5. Check cluster**  | `kubectl cluster-info`                 | `kubectl cluster-info`                               | Verify Kubernetes API/control-plane connectivity |


